+
+## Food-photo analysis
+
+The authenticated food-photo endpoint accepts a JPEG, PNG or WebP data URL up
+to 5 MB after browser resizing. It verifies the declared file type against the
+image bytes, moderates the image, and requests strict structured nutrition
+estimates. Pace does not persist the image or the analysis response. The
+frontend requires the user to review and confirm editable estimates before it
+creates normal local-first Nutrition entries.
